# Git remote and pushes

This project deploys to [QimingTian/Heroes-Around-Me-Website](https://github.com/QimingTian/Heroes-Around-Me-Website).

- **Remote**: `origin` → `https://github.com/QimingTian/Heroes-Around-Me-Website.git`
- When the user asks to push or publish the site, commit on `main` and run `git push origin main` (one commit per push unless they ask otherwise).
- Do not change `git config` or force-push `main` unless the user explicitly requests it.
